        "Content": "Spectacular  4/5 Bedroom property in a Magical Setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A truly stunning home in a naturally beautiful location with exceptionally exquisite views overlooking Baltimore Harbour\r\nThis private residential  is framed by a perfect Irish Atlantic Landscape.\r\nHaving an East to West orientation, the sun-filled home is splashed with brightness and charm.\r\nThe owners personal taste and commitment to traditional style has retained this property's numerous original features. \r\nIt is presented as a wonderful, warm, and welcoming home, with access to all the benefits of an amazing coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet over two floors, the property has 4 Bedrooms, an office, all with breathtaking views, 2 bathrooms, complimented by 2 large reception rooms, a very welcoming kitchen cum dining, with direct access to the main patio area by means of large sliding glass doors, plus a conservatory with panoramic views, running the full length of the front of the  property, ideal for many extra uses.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is equally as charming, set on c 0.5 of an acre of very private mature gardens, a little hideaway !.\r\nThe owners spend as much time as possible dining outdoors, in the many barbeque/patio areas dotted throughout the garden, while the kids enjoy climbing trees, playing hide and seek, running around the garden carefree\r\nThe mature planting ensures excellent privacy and brings in a  wide array of different  wildlife, numerous species of birds, butterflies, and honeybees which are in abundance through much of the year, hares and pheasants, breathtaking views from the patio at sunrise and sunset.\r\nWe even have off -road parking, allowing you to drive straight from the ferry crossing to your front door., Island life made easy !\r\n\r\nThe island of Sherkin is well known world -wide, mention the name, and most people will have called in at some stage.\r\nEasy accessible from Baltimore, 10 ferry crossings per day, a 15 minute trip .\r\nSherkin Island is a real beauty spot with many sandy beaches, dramatic cliffs, and panoramic views of the neighbouring islands, the Beacon, \r\nBaltimore Castle, the Mizen Peninsula, , the world famous Fastnet Rock in the distance\r\nTake the 8.00 a.m. ferry off the island in the morning, be at your office desk/ place of work, at 9.00.a.m\r\nServices: Private Sewage, Public Water, OFCH, Wood Burning Stoves \r\n\r\nThe Top house is indeed a magical property.\r\nIt has generous accommodation, a substantial site, excellent panoramic sea views, mature gardens, and a very highly desirable West Cork location, \r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious detached home within easy reach of Skibbereen and Baltimore.\r\nViewing is by appointment only"
      },
